walker H = sigma.S (2 comp/site), L=4: zero modes 16 -> 8 Weyl nodes
Kawamoto-Smit staggered (1 component/site), L=4: zero modes 8 -> 4 Weyl-equivalents (= 2 four-component Dirac)
naive Hamiltonian alpha.S (4 comp/site), L=4: zero modes 32 -> 16 Weyl-equivalents (8 Dirac)
ordered tick U=S_x S_y S_z (2 comp/site), L=12: states at U=+1: 16, at U=-1: 16 -> 16 Weyl nodes
